# .dockerignore
# Files/folders excluded from the Docker build context.
# NOTE: unlike .gitignore, we DO want data/processed/* (models, databases,
# chroma_db) copied INTO the image, since the API needs them at runtime.
# We only exclude things that are genuinely never needed inside the container.

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
.github/
data/raw/
notebooks/
tests/
transformer_checkpoints/
.env
*.md
